{"product":{"id":15417622724685,"title":"Strawberry","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eFresh, vibrant strawberries sourced directly from South Africa's premium growing regions. Each 250g pack delivers sweet, juicy berries perfect for fresh consumption, smoothies, or desserts. Hand-selected for quality and ripeness, these strawberries offer natural sweetness and are rich in vitamin C and antioxidants. Store in the refrigerator and enjoy within 3–4 days for best flavor and texture.\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUsage Instructions\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRinse strawberries gently before serving\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRemove the green tops if preferred\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eServe fresh, slice into bowls, blend into smoothies, or use as dessert topping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAdd to cakes, fruit salads, breakfast plates, pancakes, waffles, or lunchboxes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCare Instructions\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStore strawberries in the refrigerator after delivery\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKeep dry until ready to wash and serve\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvoid crushing or placing heavy items on top of the pack\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRemove any soft or damaged berries to help protect the remaining strawberries\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Driscoll's","product_type":"Fruits","created_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:50+04:00","handle":"strawberry-south-africa-250g-pack","updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:06:01+04:00","published_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:54+04:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"web","tags":"1hr-delivery, AIR, Berries, brand:Driscoll's, By air, Fruits, origin:South Africa, Strawberries","variants":[{"id":67691515740237,"product_id":15417622724685,"title":"Default Title","price":"20.50","sku":"9910772","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:50+04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:06:01+04:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"AED","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":17881111003213,"product_id":15417622724685,"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}],"images":[{"id":38091424268365,"product_id":15417622724685,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:50+04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:54+04:00","alt":"Strawberry","width":1200,"height":1200,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0791\/7312\/4173\/files\/9910772_a4d99406-43c7-446e-b542-015fe0112bfb.jpg?v=1791981114","variant_ids":[]},{"id":38091424301133,"product_id":15417622724685,"position":2,"created_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:50+04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:53+04:00","alt":"Strawberry 2","width":1200,"height":1200,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0791\/7312\/4173\/files\/9910772_d319741b-56c3-49f4-86f4-610e22fa4fa1.jpg?v=1791981113","variant_ids":[]}],"image":{"id":38091424268365,"product_id":15417622724685,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:50+04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-14T16:31:54+04:00","alt":"Strawberry","width":1200,"height":1200,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0791\/7312\/4173\/files\/9910772_a4d99406-43c7-446e-b542-015fe0112bfb.jpg?v=1791981114","variant_ids":[]}}}